+## Patch 21 — Polished Crystal variant forms in the pool
+- Owner ruling 2026-10-04: a regional/variant form (the 46 `VariantSpeciesAndFormTable` records 292..337) is a
+  different Pokemon from its species; a cosmetic form (Unown letters, Magikarp patterns, Arbok/Pikachu looks,
+  Dunsparce segments) is the same one. `getPokemon()` now returns every record, so wild, trainer, starter, static
+  and trade pools draw the variant forms with their own BaseData stats and types (similar strength, type themes and
+  legendary bans see the form's record); UPR's alt-forme options stay off. EGG, the unused $100 and Unown stay banned.
+- A site reads as the record its (species, form) resolves to (a variant form, else the species), so wild slots,
+  trainer mons, script sites and both NPC trade sides with a formed mon are now in the model.
+- `writeSpecies` is the one writer: a site that still holds the same record is not touched (a cosmetic form stays);
+  otherwise LOW(species), then the site's gender/egg bits | HIGH(species) << 5 | form, the form being the variant's,
+  or the site's own NO_FORM/PLAIN_FORM for a species, or the context's plain spelling (NO_FORM for wild, trainer and
+  trade sites, PLAIN_FORM for givepoke/loadwildmon) when the site held a variant or cosmetic form.
+- `config/polished_offsets.ini` supplement: StaticSite44..48, the five resolved formed script sites (the Galarian
+  birds at Cherrygrove Bay, Alolan Exeggutor on Shamouti Island, Hisuian Typhlosion in the Violet Outskirts house).
